3 AWS Scenario-Based Questions.

1. EC2 Troubleshooting Scenario

Question:
A developer reports that their EC2 instance in a private subnet can’t access the internet. How would you troubleshoot and fix this?

What to cover:

• Check subnet routing table (missing NAT Gateway?).

• Validate Security Group and NACL rules.

• Confirm instance role and IAM permissions (if using SSM or CLI).

• Use VPC Flow Logs for deeper inspection


