2. S3 Security & Lifecycle Scenario

Question:
You’re asked to store application logs in S3 with secure access and automatic cleanup after 30 days. How would you implement this?

What to cover:

• Create an S3 bucket with encryption (SSE-S3 or SSE-KMS).

• Use bucket policies or IAM roles for access control.

• Enable versioning if needed.

• Configure lifecycle rules to transition or delete objects after 30 days.


