3. VPC Design for EKS or Jenkins

Question:
Design a VPC for hosting Jenkins and EKS with public access to Jenkins and private access to EKS nodes.

What to cover:

• Public subnet for Jenkins with IGW and Security Group for port 8080.

• Private subnet for EKS worker nodes with NAT Gateway.

• Route tables for public/private separation.

• Use IAM roles for Jenkins to trigger Terraform or EKS deployments
